  "description": "Production-grade Firebase Cloud Messaging (push notifications) for .NET: automatic batching over FCM's 500-token limit, dead-token reporting, topic broadcast, retry with backoff, explicit fail-open behaviour, and an optional built-in device-token store (generic-key, provider-neutral, self-migrating) that owns the FirebaseUserDevices table, prunes dead tokens, keeps an in-app inbox, and audits every send.",
  "id": "AQZ.Firebase.Toolkit",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-09T08:23:01.687Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
