  "packageHash": "4IqFFzr5hEecHdfWboJR0DMF/XIzdZ7L3gkETucZEnbXg4DLothZU5Ly3uytZM0rFSLzG2zbONwncDEWojfhKw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 81647,
  "published": "2026-09-09T08:12:58.163Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "3.4.0: complete send auditing. Every send — Users, Broadcast, Tokens, Topic and Condition — now writes one summary row (audience, message, success/failure/invalid counts, optional actor) to a new FirebaseNotificationDispatches table, queryable via INotificationDispatchStore<TKey>. One row per send, so broadcasts stay cheap. Toggle with FirebaseStoreOptions.PersistDispatchAudit (default true); capture the sender by registering IPushActorAccessor. Adds a new table: generate one store migration after upgrading. Non-breaking for callers of the public interfaces; note UserPushService now depends on the concrete PushNotificationService internally (DI wiring only). 3.3.0: data/options types unsealed for inheritance.",
